{"4063370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadows Must Fall", "steam_appid": 4063370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows Must Fall is a top-down arena shooter roguelite where you play collect weapons &amp; build towers to fight off hordes of shadow monsters. Choose from a variety of upgrades and items to create unique builds and survive until the light cleanses the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/241678c580604db630e76a27e41607bf.poster.avif?t=1776918820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/241678c580604db630e76a27e41607bf.webm?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/241678c580604db630e76a27e41607bf.mp4?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Living Fortress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn weapons into towers mid-run and reshape the battlefield as the horde closes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise walls, carve choke points, and engineer deadly paths that force enemies exactly where you want them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/ddbe117f423f33036d7aeb2788c332a4.poster.avif?t=1776918820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/ddbe117f423f33036d7aeb2788c332a4.webm?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/ddbe117f423f33036d7aeb2788c332a4.mp4?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Game-Breaking Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socket jewels to transform how your weapons behave, then stack powerful relics to push your strategy to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase synergies, experiment with wild combinations, and forge a unique build every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/293b9648614d777a87c99b2489445070.poster.avif?t=1776918820\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/293b9648614d777a87c99b2489445070.webm?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/293b9648614d777a87c99b2489445070.mp4?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reshape the Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how the battlefield expands, which monsters emerge, and what terrain you’ll fight across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice alters the flow of the run, forcing you to adapt your build, defenses, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows Must Fall is a top-down arena shooter roguelite where you play collect weapons &amp; build towers to fight off hordes of shadow monsters. Choose from a variety of upgrades and items to create unique builds and survive until the light cleanses the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i